    <!-- Bowls nest and rest on a capsule cone (contype 4) that the gripper jaws (contype 8) pass through. The jaws
         grip bowl_rim instead: 2 mm plates on the real vertical rim (mid-wall radius 61.5 mm, 0.5 to 18.5 mm above
         the bowl origin, measured from bowl.stl), massless, colliding only with the jaws, with stiff contacts so the
         squeezed thin wall does not let the jaws sink in. -->
